OL,3,GNEWSAConcern after SEND swimming       
OL,4,Asessions are cancelled                 
OL,6,FA mum has said she felt "emotional"    
OL,7,Fsince the cancellation of Special      
OL,8,FEducational Needs and Disabilities     
OL,9,F(SEND) swimming lessons.               
OL,11,FJessica from Bridport, Dorset, said    
OL,12,Flessons at Bridport Leisure Centre had 
OL,13,Fbeen beneficial for her eight-year-old 
OL,14,Fson Louis, who was diagnosed with      
OL,15,Fautism, global developmental delay and 
OL,16,Fwas awaiting an ADHD diagnosis.        
