OL,3,GNEWSAConcern after SEND swimming       
OL,4,Asessions are cancelled                 
OL,6,FThe centre said the decision had not   
OL,7,Fbeen taken due to "safety and          
OL,8,Fsafeguarding concerns" and they        
OL,9,F"couldn't be confident the sessions    
OL,10,Fcould continue to the standards set by 
OL,11,FSwim England".                         
OL,13,FJessica said her son had been nonverbal
OL,14,Fwhen he had started school: "Now he's  
OL,15,Fstarting to string sentences together, 
OL,16,Fso he's got a little bit more          
OL,17,Fawareness."                            
